1
00:00:00,349 --> 00:00:03,689
(Leonard:)Will the gentleman from the great
state of denial yield for a question?

2
00:00:04,311 --> 00:00:06,691
- I will yield.
- After we go through the exercise...

3
00:00:06,855 --> 00:00:09,985
(Leonard:)...of an annoying series of votes,
which the gentleman will lose...

4
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:12,570
...does he intend to quit
if he does not get his way?

5
00:00:12,736 --> 00:00:16,116
(Leonard:)- He does.
- We are the Army Ants. All those in favor?

6
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:21,490
(Penny:)Good afternoon and welcome
to today's Physics Bowl practice round.

7
00:00:21,662 --> 00:00:23,702
(Penny:)I'm Penny,
and I'll be your host because...

8
00:00:23,872 --> 00:00:26,792
(Penny:)...I didn't have anything else
to do on a Saturday afternoon...

9
00:00:26,959 --> 00:00:29,539
(Penny:)...and isn't that just a little sad?

10
00:00:31,129 --> 00:00:32,669
(Penny:)- Gentlemen, are you ready?
LEONARD: Yes.

11
00:00:32,839 --> 00:00:34,969
HOWARD: Fire away.
- It's none of my business...

12
00:00:35,133 --> 00:00:38,343
...but is a guy who can't speak
in front of women gonna hold you back?

13
00:00:38,512 --> 00:00:41,222
Oh, he'll be okay once the women
are mixed into the crowd.

14
00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:44,930
(Leonard:)He only has a problem
when they're one-on-one and smell nice.

15
00:00:45,102 --> 00:00:47,432
(Penny:)Oh, thanks, Raj. It's vanilla oil.

16
00:00:47,771 --> 00:00:51,021
(Leonard:)I was actually the one who noticed.
Okay, let's just start.

17
00:00:51,191 --> 00:00:53,651
(Penny:)Okay, the first question
is on the topic of optics.

18
00:00:53,819 --> 00:00:56,069
"What is the shortest light pulse
ever produced?"

19
00:00:56,238 --> 00:00:57,278
[BUZZER SOUNDS]

20
00:00:57,447 --> 00:01:00,827
(Penny:)- Dr. Cooper.
- Of course, the answer is 130 attoseconds.

